# Turn presses reach the game (through the press latch): one press, one turn.
# The BIOS intro, licence screen and loading take ~15 s; the cycle starts north
wait 15.5
# The game starts in 1st person; these steps were written from iso, so switch to it first
press down
wait 0.3
press left
wait 0.5
shot turn_1_west
press right
wait 0.3
press right
wait 0.5
shot turn_2_east
